Z||000009||tpeerson||02-24-2001||09:48 PM||||I've got an Indy style scoop with the strobe lights. Photos can be seen at <A HREF="http://www.MoreThanMeetsTheEye.com/indy" TARGET=_blank>http://www.MoreThanMeetsTheEye.com/indy</A>  . I've since stripped the paint, and put two coats of primer on it. Now I'm trying to get the strobe power supplys working. They don't do anything. <P>------------------<BR>Tim Peerson<BR>87 V8 Testarossa rebody in progress<BR>http://www.MoreThanMeetsTheEye.com/vroom<BR>||||reg||1
